      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present the case of a 33 year old man who consulted because a lumbago; a bone lesion was detected on a lumbosacral radiography, and finally was diagnosed of Multiple Myeloma. The illness, diagnosis and epidemiology are briefly analyzed, rebounding the rarity of its presentation in a young man."},
